1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:03,080
Okay so in terms of makeup I do want to keep it pretty minimalistic.
好了，说到妆容，我确实想尽量保持简单。

2
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:05,560
And I just thought I'd yap to you for a couple minutes whilst I get ready.
我就想着，准备的时候跟你们聊上几分钟。

3
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:10,600
I genuinely like I'm not trying to be annoying but I feel like my skin it's freaking out.
说真的，我不是想惹人烦，但我感觉我的皮肤最近状态失控了。

4
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:14,919
Like I don't know it's just like so you can just tell I'm ill from my skin I feel like.
我也说不上来，就是从我的皮肤能看出我病了，我是这么觉得的。

5
00:00:14,919 --> 00:00:18,119
And it's making me feel so unconident but I'm trying to like ignore it.
这让我很没自信，不过我在努力不去理会。

6
00:00:18,119 --> 00:00:22,760
I feel like it's only cuz I look at myself so much like no one else really notices it so trying to get over that.
我觉得只是因为自己太常看自己了，别人其实根本没怎么注意，所以我想把这件事放下。

7
00:00:22,760 --> 00:00:30,200
But you know when like something just gets you feeling like for me when my skin isn't like clear I'm just like I feel so much less confident.
但你们懂那种感觉吧，有些事情就是会影响心情。对我来说，皮肤不清透时，我会很没自信。

8
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:37,470
But realistically like no one else notices it so just think I actually need to get over but I keep looking at myself being like oh can my skin please clear.
可实际上别人都没注意，所以我觉得自己真该放下这件事，但还是不停照镜子，想着皮肤能不能快点好起来。

9
00:00:37,480 --> 00:00:44,040
Anyways we made it into second year guys if you have been following my year 1 journey or my gcse journey my a level journey.
总之，我们上大二了。如果你们一直关注我从大一、GCSE 或 A level 阶段一路走来的经历，

10
00:00:44,040 --> 00:00:49,480
You'll know that I am a ucr medic I just completed first year we passed which was amazing.
就会知道我是一名医学学生。我刚读完大一，考试也通过了，特别开心。

11
00:00:49,480 --> 00:00:53,080
I had 4 months of summer like which is like actually crazy.
我有四个月暑假，真的有点夸张。

12
00:00:53,080 --> 00:01:01,160
Like my final exam was may 21 st and I didn't go back to uni till september 28 th like genuinely 4 months of uni.
期末考是五月二十一日，直到九月二十八日才回学校，确实有四个月左右。

13
00:01:01,160 --> 00:01:09,080
By the way I'm just using this like dr jar soothing color correcting treatment on my forehead and stuff just so that you can't see the redness of my spots as much.
顺便说，我正在额头等地方用这个舒缓调色产品，让痘痘的红色不那么明显。

14
00:01:09,080 --> 00:01:13,560
And I also don't like putting much makeup on my spots so this is probably like all I'll do.
我也不喜欢在痘痘上化很多妆，所以这大概就是我会做的全部了。

15
00:01:13,560 --> 00:01:18,119
But yeah I'm honestly like a little bit scared for year two I've been feeling pretty anxious recently.
嗯，说实话我有点怕大二，最近一直挺焦虑的。

16
00:01:18,119 --> 00:01:23,640
I think it's just because like I haven't been back at uni for so long like it genuinely has been ages.
我想只是因为太久没回学校了，真的已经过了好久。

17
00:01:23,640 --> 00:01:27,320
I'm just like I've forgotten how to work I've forgotten how to sit in a lecture and listen.
我就觉得，自己忘了怎么学习，也忘了怎么坐在课堂里听课。

18
00:01:27,320 --> 00:01:33,799
Like and it's always different at different unis depending on the course but basically ucr med second year is like notoriously one of the hardest years.
当然，不同学校、不同专业都会不一样。不过据她说，医学生的大二出了名地是最难的学年之一。

19
00:01:33,799 --> 00:01:41,400
Like every second year I speak to second year is such a fun year the topics are super interesting but the workload is genuinely like double year one.
我聊过的大二学生都说，大二很有趣，主题很有意思，但工作量真的差不多是大一的两倍。

20
00:01:41,400 --> 00:01:46,359
So everyone I speak to is like it's fine because the content's so interesting like you don't mind it as much.
所以大家都说还好，因为内容有趣，就没有那么介意。

21
00:01:46,359 --> 00:01:48,919
But it is like double the amount like you've got to keep on top.
但分量确实翻倍了，你得一直跟上。

22
00:01:48,919 --> 00:01:51,160
I am a little bit nervous but it should be fine.
我有一点紧张，不过应该没事。

23
00:01:51,160 --> 00:01:57,880
Basically at the moment we just have a bunch of like introductory lectures just like welcoming us back to uni an overview of year 2.
基本上，现在就是一些介绍性讲座，欢迎我们返校，并概述大二的安排。

24
00:01:57,880 --> 00:02:06,520
I think I said this earlier but like how we're assessed etc our first module that we're doing is mmb which is muscle muscular skeletal biology I think it stands for.
我好像前面说过，就是怎么考核之类。第一个模块叫 MMB，她猜全称与肌肉、肌骨生物学有关。

25
00:02:06,520 --> 00:02:11,799
But basically last year we did like the abdomen and the thorax and now we're doing like the upper and lower limbs.
基本上，去年学了腹部和胸部，现在要学上肢和下肢。

26
00:02:11,799 --> 00:02:18,359
I think this week we start on the upper limb learning the anatomy there's so much anatomy in this module like it's genuinely crazy.
我想这周先学上肢，学习它的解剖。这个模块解剖内容特别多，多得有点夸张。

27
00:02:18,359 --> 00:02:25,000
I'm going to be ankying so hard but like surprisingly I don't mind anatomy I just feel like it is so ankiable.
我要拼命刷 Anki 了。不过意外的是，我不讨厌解剖，因为感觉它很适合用 Anki 来学。

28
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:31,799
By the way if you didn't know what anki is it's just like a flashcard like online app type thing but yeah I will just be anking anatomy 24/7 this year.
顺便说，如果你不知道 Anki，它就是一类网上抽认卡应用。我今年会一直用它复习解剖。

29
00:02:31,799 --> 00:02:35,640
Also if I'm looking over here it's cuz my mirror is here so I'm just like flickering back and forth.
还有，如果我一直往这边看，那是因为镜子在这里，所以我就在两边来回看。

30
00:02:35,640 --> 00:02:42,359
I'm also social sec this year for rums tennis runs as like the med tennis team which is actually so exciting.
今年我还担任网球队的社交活动负责人。她解释这是医学网球队，这件事很让人兴奋。

31
00:02:42,359 --> 00:02:48,349
So if you don't know what social set is it's basically like in committee the person that runs the socials is pretty self explanatory.
如果你不知道这个职务，就是委员会里负责组织社交活动的人，名称本身其实就很明白。

32
00:02:48,359 --> 00:02:55,789
But like in terms of sports nights curry nights I get to plan tour which is super exciting I've been planning that recently with my other social sex.
比如体育社交夜、咖喱聚餐夜，我还能规划集体出行，特别让人期待。最近我和另一位活动负责人就在筹备。

33
00:02:55,799 --> 00:03:01,239
So I am a little bit nervous cuz I also think like that is like a whole another job on top of uni and doing social media.
所以我有一点紧张，因为我也觉得，在读大学和做社交媒体之外，这简直又多了一份工作。

34
00:03:01,239 --> 00:03:06,520
But like it's so fun and it's such a big part of my social life that like I feel so grateful to be on committee.
但这很有趣，而且是我社交生活中非常重要的一部分，所以能进委员会我很感激。

35
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:09,799
And it's something that I want to contribute to by being a social psych you know.
我也想通过担任这个活动职务作出贡献。

36
00:03:09,799 --> 00:03:13,880
The only other like main update I have for you is that I'm now like fully settled in my flat.
还有一个主要近况，就是我现在已经在公寓里完全安顿好了。

37
00:03:13,880 --> 00:03:19,320
If you didn't watch my like moving into my second year uni house vlog then I would definitely go watch that it was so much fun.
如果你还没看我搬进大二住处的那期视频，我肯定建议你看看，那次很有趣。

38
00:03:19,320 --> 00:03:25,160
Fully settled back into london I literally love living in london like I'm such a city person through and through to my core.
我已经重新适应伦敦的生活了。我真的很喜欢住伦敦，从里到外都是个爱城市的人。

39
00:03:25,160 --> 00:03:29,239
And in general just some life updates promise I'll stop yapping soon I'm very almost done with my makeup.
这些大致就是最近的生活更新。我保证马上就不聊了，妆也快化好了。

40
00:03:29,239 --> 00:03:34,760
But I'm running the oxford half marathon next weekend or like two weekends time october the 11 th.
不过我下周末，或者说再过两个周末，要跑牛津半程马拉松，日期是十月十一日。

41
00:03:34,760 --> 00:03:38,760
By the time this video comes out it'll be like exactly a week today which is so exciting.
等视频发出来的时候，离比赛就正好还有一周了，特别期待。

42
00:03:38,760 --> 00:03:48,669
I honestly think that's about it with life updates like genuinely there's just so much going on uni socially like so many housewarmings so many birthdays actually.
我想生活近况差不多就是这些。最近真有很多事，学校、社交，还有很多乔迁聚会和生日聚会。

43
00:03:48,679 --> 00:03:54,349
And also being social obviously all the tennis socials so my october is pretty booked up which I love so exciting.
还有负责的各种网球社交活动，所以十月已经排得满满的。我很喜欢，也很期待。

44
00:03:54,359 --> 00:04:01,160
But also like probably why I've been feeling a bit like nervous recently just cuz there's so much going on and I'm used to genuinely just chilling throughout summer.
不过这大概也是我最近有点紧张的原因，因为事情太多，而我已经习惯了整个夏天都很放松。

45
00:04:01,160 --> 00:04:06,359
Genuinely I'm so excited for year two like I'm so excited I think it'll be such a good year.
真的特别期待大二，太期待了。我想这一年会很棒。

46
00:04:06,359 --> 00:04:10,319
And I'm so excited to take you guys along with me and hopefully you enjoy all my year 2 vlogs.
我也很期待带着你们一起经历，希望你们喜欢我的大二视频。
